    "reviews": "\u201cPoetry in Purgatory, to me, is a groundbreaking visual novel. It explores its various themes with care, sensibility and with a sense of depth that many could only dream of.\u201d<br>User Review<br><br>\u201cFantastic work, from the characters to the art to the overall narrative to all of the additional side content you can do, this is a fantastic VN so far, one of my most anticipated releases!\u201d<br>User Review<br><br>\u201cThe plot is completely captivating and some of the characters are just so despicable that they're loveable. I haven't even finished yet and I'm already begging for more.\u201d<br>User Review<br>",
